%section#discussion.band
  .prose
    %h2 Discussion
    - if giscus?
      %p Questions, photos of what you made, and bug reports. Sign in with GitHub to post.
      %script{src: 'https://giscus.app/client.js', async: true, crossorigin: 'anonymous',
              data: {repo: 'kigster/makeabox', repo_id: ENV.fetch('GISCUS_REPO_ID'), category: ENV.fetch('GISCUS_CATEGORY', 'General'),
                     category_id: ENV.fetch('GISCUS_CATEGORY_ID'), mapping: 'pathname', strict: '0', reactions_enabled: '1',
                     emit_metadata: '0', input_position: 'top', theme: 'dark_dimmed', lang: 'en', loading: 'lazy'}}
    - else
      %p
        Questions, photos of what you made, and bug reports live on GitHub.
        = succeed '.' do
          %a{href: 'https://github.com/kigster/makeabox/discussions'} Join the discussion
